CleanCity — AI-Based Waste Cleanup Verification System

Project Overview

CleanCity is a hackathon project focused on improving the verification of waste cleanup activities using before-and-after photographs.

Key Objectives

- Verify cleanup activities using before-and-after images.
- Categorize waste into wet, dry, and hazardous waste.
- Check whether the photographs correspond to the same location using visual and background consistency.
- Support transparent and reliable waste management.

Proposed Workflow

1. Capture a photograph before cleanup.
2. Perform the cleanup and capture an after photograph.
3. Compare the photographs to assess whether they show the same location.
4. Classify the waste where the required classification functionality is available.
5. Record the verification result.

